# Buffalo, algebraic geometry, part 03: 11 June 1973 (from 8:43:41) – 12 June 1973 (to 1:36:31)

The entries of `docs/buffalo-ag/index.tex` lines 356–491, split by video into `Part03a`
(`51wmmpHand0`, 8:43:41–10:30:48), `Part03b` (`_lTf_L0yvrU`, 3:45:53–4:59:18) and `Part03c`
(`thSz9ZHDK9o`, 0:01:06–1:36:31), all in the namespace `Buffalo.AG.Part03`, on top of the
framework of `Buffalo.AG.Part01`. The status of each entry is in
`docs/buffalo-ag/lean/Part03.json`.

Main results proved here: faithfully flat descent in degrees 0 and 1 for every module
(`descent_exact`, `thm_35250`), by base change to `A'` and a contracting homotopy; the faithful
flatness of `A → ∏ A_{f_i}` for a covering (`prop_37263`); the injectivity of `Spec` on
epimorphisms of rings (`prop_1836`); the surjectivity and non-injectivity of
`Spec(A ⊗_K B) → Spec A × Spec B` (`prop_33240`); the points and closed sets of the affine line and
the fibres of the plane over it (`ex_34080`, `ex_34212`, `ex_34277`, `ex_33562`).

Not formalised (no carrier in mathlib): homotopies between Čech complexes of two coverings
(`37068`), complex analytic spaces and `X^an` (`37782`, `37848`).
